WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.080
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:14.960
The reading from the Sinaxadion, for October 1st, on which we commemorate, St. Romano's

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.390
the Melodist.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:23.310
Our Holy Father Romano's was from Emesa, in Syria.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:30.950
He became Deacon of the Church of Berritos, Beirut, and settled in Constantinople during

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:38.190
the reign of the Emperor Anastasios I, about the year 496.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.150
His virtuous life was a shining example to the faithful, and he fulfilled his duties conscientiously

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:51.870
at the Church of the Mother of God of Cyrus, to which he was appointed.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:58.630
But Romano's had not been blessed with a well-modulated voice, so was unable to glorify the

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:03.950
Creator melodiously as he wanted to.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:10.670
One Christmas in the Church of Blacierne, at the vigil of the Nativity, the Mother of God

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:18.270
appeared to him, holding in her hand a scroll which she gave him to eat.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:25.670
As soon as he tasted it, an indescribable sweetness filled his mouth, and going up into

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:34.430
the Ambo, he began to intone in an angelic voice the contacune that has come down to us.

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:41.750
Today the Virgin gives birth to him who is above all being.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:46.630
The gift remained with him for the rest of his life, through the inspiration of the Holy

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:54.350
Spirit he adorned most of the feasts of the liturgical year with wonderful hymns.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:59.470
More than 1,000 contaccia are ascribed to him.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:05.890
Some say that he also composed the renowned acethyst to the Mother of God.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:14.830
Saint Romano's died in peace sometime after the year 555, to join the angelic choir, but

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:19.590
he so well represented on earth.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:26.030
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's, O Lord Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:27.190
and save us.
